{"id": "math_phi1024", "category": "math", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T00:01:49", "prompt_tokens": 79, "completion_tokens": 187, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 29.074388699254055, "wall_s": 7.143, "reasoning_chars": 223, "score": 1, "detail": {"expected": "512", "boxed": "512"}, "content": "质因数分解：\n\n\\[\n1024 = 2^{10}\n\\]\n\n欧拉函数：\n\n\\[\n\\varphi(1024)=\\varphi(2^{10})=2^{10}-2^{9}=1024-512=512\n\\]\n\n最终整数答案：\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{512}\n\\]"}
{"id": "math_zeros100", "category": "math", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T00:02:01", "prompt_tokens": 73, "completion_tokens": 340, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 29.280280344432835, "wall_s": 11.986, "reasoning_chars": 259, "score": 1, "detail": {"expected": "24", "boxed": "24"}, "content": "100! 十进制末尾零的个数等于其质因数分解中因子 \\(5\\) 的个数（因为因子 \\(2\\) 更多）：\n\n\\[\nZ(100!) = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{5} \\right\\rfloor + \\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{5^2} \\right\\rfloor + \\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{5^3} \\right\\rfloor + \\cdots\n\\]\n\n计算：\n\n\\[\n\\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{5} \\right\\rfloor = 20\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{25} \\right\\rfloor = 4\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\left\\lfloor \\frac{100}{125} \\right\\rfloor = 0\n\\]\n\n所以：\n\n\\[\nZ(100!) = 20 + 4 = 24\n\\]\n\n最终答案：\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{24}\n\\]"}
{"id": "math_pow7", "category": "math", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T00:03:25", "prompt_tokens": 76, "completion_tokens": 2431, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 28.974696040235763, "wall_s": 84.275, "reasoning_chars": 3276, "score": 1, "detail": {"expected": "649", "boxed": "649"}, "content": "我们要求：\n\n\\[\n7^{2026} \\bmod 1000\n\\]\n\n先找 \\(7\\) 模 \\(1000\\) 的周期。计算：\n\n\\[\n7^2 = 49\n\\]\n\n\\[\n7^4 = 2401 \\equiv 401 \\pmod{1000}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n7^8 \\equiv 401^2 = 160801 \\equiv 801 \\pmod{1000}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n7^{16} \\equiv 801^2 = 641601 \\equiv 601 \\pmod{1000}\n\\]\n\n于是\n\n\\[\n7^{20} = 7^{16}7^4 \\equiv 601 \\times 401 = 241001 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{1000}\n\\]\n\n所以\n\n\\[\n7^{20} \\equiv 1 \\pmod{1000}\n\\]\n\n因此指数可以对 \\(20\\) 取余：\n\n\\[\n2026 = 20 \\times 101 + 6\n\\]\n\n所以\n\n\\[\n7^{2026} \\equiv 7^6 \\pmod{1000}\n\\]\n\n计算：\n\n\\[\n7^6 = 117649\n\\]\n\n\\[\n117649 \\bmod 1000 = 649\n\\]\n\n因此最终整数答案是：\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{649}\n\\]"}
{"id": "code_palindrome", "category": "code", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T00:03:34", "prompt_tokens": 87, "completion_tokens": 240, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 28.72192251810743, "wall_s": 8.615, "reasoning_chars": 744, "score": 1, "detail": {"returncode": 0, "stdout_tail": "PASS\n", "stderr_tail": "", "code_head": "def is_palindrome(s: str) -> bool:\n    cleaned = [ch.lower() for ch in s if ch.isalnum()]\n    return cleaned == cleaned[::-1]\n"}, "content": "```python\ndef is_palindrome(s: str) -> bool:\n    cleaned = [ch.lower() for ch in s if ch.isalnum()]\n    return cleaned == cleaned[::-1]\n```"}
{"id": "code_count_vowels", "category": "code", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T00:03:39", "prompt_tokens": 88, "completion_tokens": 144, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 28.525064655150917, "wall_s": 5.457, "reasoning_chars": 397, "score": 1, "detail": {"returncode": 0, "stdout_tail": "PASS\n", "stderr_tail": "", "code_head": "def count_vowels(s):\n    return sum(1 for ch in s.lower() if ch in \"aeiou\")\n"}, "content": "```python\ndef count_vowels(s):\n    return sum(1 for ch in s.lower() if ch in \"aeiou\")\n```"}
{"id": "code_binary_search", "category": "code", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T00:03:49", "prompt_tokens": 86, "completion_tokens": 245, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps": 27.939133909749728, "wall_s": 9.165, "reasoning_chars": 590, "score": 1, "detail": {"returncode": 0, "stdout_tail": "PASS\n", "stderr_tail": "", "code_head": "def binary_search(arr, target):\n    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    return -1\n"}, "content": "```python\ndef binary_search(arr, target):\n    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    return -1\n```"}
